{"id":"en_you-faked-our-marriage-so-i-married-the-richest-man","title":"You Faked Our Marriage, So I Married the Richest Man","titleEn":"You Faked Our Marriage, So I Married the Richest Man","description":"For three years, Irene Henry believed she was married to Ethan Hall, until she learned the certificate was forged. He had also spread the lie that she could not conceive and used her business skills to sustain the Hall Group's IPO. Once the deception surfaced, Irene walked away, only to find she was the only heir to the influential Henry Group. She came back to take control of her family's empire and swiftly brought Ethan's failing company to its knees. His attitude shifted from contempt to pleas for a second chance, each attempt met with humiliation. An arranged marriage introduced her to Julian, head of the Grant family, who was drawn to her resilience and remained loyal through public attacks, a kidnapping, and warehouse fires. Irene ultimately held on to her empire, found genuine love,","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/you-faked-our-marriage-so-i-married-the-richest-man/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/you-faked-our-marriage-so-i-married-the-richest-man/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjpq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_you-faked-our-marriage-so-i-married-the-richest-man_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjpq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_you-faked-our-marriage-so-i-married-the-richest-man_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcjpq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","download